Gur grfgf ner ohvyg gur fnzr jnl: gurl xrrc gur freire svkrq naq zbir gur pybpx. Sbe gur svefg
unys, ernq gur qbp pbzzrag bs gur `VafrpherFxvcIrevsl` svryq bs `gyf.Pbasvt` pybfryl: vg gryyf lbh
